OL,3,GNEWSAMosaic project fears closure due
OL,4,Ato pavilion plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn art group known for its colourful
OL,7,Ftile designs in Hackney is campaigning
OL,8,Fagainst plans to change its venue.
OL,10,FThe Mosaic Project is facing an
OL,11,Funcertain future, after working from
OL,12,Fthe Hackney Downs Pavilion for the past
OL,13,F12 years.
OL,15,FHackney Council has consulted on plans
OL,16,Fto turn the venue into a cafe and a
OL,17,Fspace that can be hired by the hour. It
OL,18,Fsays the group would be welcome to
OL,19,Fcontinue working there.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
