OL,3,GNEWSAMosaic project fears closure due
OL,4,Ato pavilion plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the Mosaic Project say they
OL,7,Fwere hoping for a dedicated area within
OL,8,Fthe building and fear that without a
OL,9,Fsuitable place to go it might have to
OL,10,Fclose.
